---
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About ${SITE_NAME}`} description={`${SITE_NAME} helps readers discover places worth visiting across the United States and plan with official sources.`} path="/about/">
  <section class="container section-block">
    <div class="page-intro"><h1>About {SITE_NAME}</h1></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>{SITE_NAME} is an independent guide to places worth visiting across the United States. Our <a href="/destinations/">destination pages</a> show what makes a place interesting, who might enjoy it and what to check before going.</p>
      <h2>Travel planning</h2>
      <p>Our <a href="/guides/">travel guides</a> help with the practical decisions that shape a visit, from choosing a route to comparing tickets. They include official references and dates for changing information.</p>
      <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for how we check sources and use automated tools. <a href="/photo-credits/">Photo credits</a> records the creators and reuse terms for site imagery.</p>
      <h2>Independence and support</h2>
      <p>Any future advertising will be identified and kept separate from editorial decisions. See our <a href="/advertising/">advertising disclosure</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
